    "Photos you swipe left on go to the trash inside this app. They are only deleted when you empty the trash, and iOS keeps them in Recently Deleted for another 30 days." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "左滑的照片会先进到这个 App 的垃圾桶，只有在你清空垃圾桶时才会删除；之后 iOS 还会在“最近删除”再保留 30 天。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "左滑的照片會先進到這個 App 的垃圾桶，只有在你清空垃圾桶時才會刪除；之後 iOS 還會在「最近刪除」再保留 30 天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Progress, trash and statistics will be cleared. Your photos stay in your library." : {
